==Bracket==

For each of the first two quarter-finals, one team progressing from group 1 was drawn against one team progressing from group 2. For the remaining two quarter-finals, this procedure was repeated for groups 3 and 4.<ref name="jura">{{cite news |work=[[Journal du Jura]] |date=1954-06-16 |page=5 |title=Aujourd'hui commence le tour final de la Coupe du Monde de football |url=https://www.e-newspaperarchives.ch/?a=d&d=JDJ19540616-01.2.22 |location=Bienne, Switzerland |language=fr|via=[[e-newspaperarchives.ch]]}}</ref>

For the semi-finals, a further draw was held, with each semi-final featuring one team from groups 1–2 against one team from groups 3–4.<ref name="jura"/>

